    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "S’il ressent des émotions trop fortes, il en fera taire la source, quelle qu’elle soit, en utilisant des méthodes assez violentes.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "No matter who you are, if you bring strong emotions near this Pokémon, it will silence you violently.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "強い　感情を　もつ　ものは それが　誰であれ　黙らせる。 その手段は　じつに　乱暴。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il frappe ses ennemis avec ses tresses pour les faire taire. Sa puissance est telle qu’il peut mettre K.O. un boxeur professionnel d’un seul coup.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Using the braids on its head, it pummels foes to get them to quiet down. One blow from those braids would knock out a professional boxer.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "頭の房で　相手を　殴り 黙らせる。　プロボクサーさえ 一発　ＫＯの　破壊力。",
        "language": {
